1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:00,490
You watched

2
00:00:00,490 --> 00:00:01,550
the whole tutorial.

3
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:02,610
So why can't you play

4
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:03,520
the first chord?

5
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:04,550
Watching the steps

6
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:05,120
can feel like

7
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:05,720
knowing them.

8
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,430
But recognizing a move

9
00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:08,250
isn't the same

10
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,140
as doing it.

11
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:10,130
Try this:

12
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:11,250
pause the video.

13
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:12,040
Play one chord

14
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,000
without looking.

15
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:13,800
Stuck?

16
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,070
Check that one step.

17
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:16,400
Then hide the screen

18
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,380
and try again.

19
00:00:17,790 --> 00:00:18,640
Don't measure learning

20
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,550
by how easy

21
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:21,040
the explanation feels.

22
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,170
See what you can do

23
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:23,010
when the explanation

24
00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:23,650
is gone.
